{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026e4afoJxZ6Y1794813378.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產太古城東山閣資深區域營業董事趙鴻運表示，分行新近促成鯉景灣買賣成交，單位為逸榮閣中低層H室，實用面積799平方呎，屬3房1套間隔，向西北，望郵輪碼頭及東九龍海景，附企理裝修。單位早前以1,390萬元放售，幾經商討後，累減30萬元，最終以1,360萬元成交，折合實用呎價17,021元。<br/>據了解，原業主於2013年以972萬買入，持貨13年，一直作自住用途，是次轉手賬面累賺388萬元，賺幅達4成。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:24:07.204672+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T13:37:22.269231+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T10:17:23.060531+00:00","content_hash":"38b93abde66abd2d9b00af2db3365647bd84f345b7025ad83bf9fd467d340bc4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}